\par }\pard\plain \s36\qj\widctlpar\adjustright \i\f1\fs22\cgrid {This small tutorial will guide you through the important steps that are necessary to create a concave physical object (in this case, a ring). On how to create a default phys
ical world and simulate it, please refer to \ldblquote Quickstart 1\rdblquote . In here you will find code excerpts from the example source \ldblquote }{\i0 ive_quickstart_ring.cxx}{\rdblquote , located  in the \ldblquote }{\i0 IVP_Sample_Sources}{
