\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \f1\fs22\cgrid {
\par This callback will be passed a pointer to an }{\i IVP_Event_Collision}{ which provides various details on the collision: the exact location (world coordinates) the collision occured at, the colliding objects, the speed of the collision, and some more...

\par To add a new listener to an object use the following example code:
