\par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab new Example_Callback_Listener_Collision();
\par cube->add_listener_collision(collision_listener);
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \f1\fs22\cgrid {In addition to just listen to simple collisions, you may also retrieve information about the contact point management. See include file }{\i ivp_listener_collision.hxx}{ for details.
