\par m_world_f_object.vimult4(pos_world_space, &pos_object_space);\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl\adjustright \f1\fs22\cgrid {\row }\pard \qj\widctlpar\adjustright {
\par Notes: 
\par All matrices used by the Ipion engine are orthonormized (For experts: quaternions, too). 
\par Vectors are column vectors. 
